<p>Hi <%= @interview.interviewer.presence || "there" %>,</p>

<p>You've been scheduled to interview <strong><%= @interview.candidate.name %></strong><% if @interview.candidate.job %> for the <strong><%= @interview.candidate.job.title %></strong> position<% end %>. Details below:</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:16px 0;">
  <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#666;">Candidate</td><td><strong><%= @interview.candidate.name %></strong></td></tr>
  <% if @interview.candidate.job %>
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#666;">Job / Position</td><td><%= @interview.candidate.job.title %></td></tr>
  <% end %>
  <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#666;">Date &amp; Time</td><td><%= @interview.scheduled_display %></td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#666;">Interview Type</td><td><%= @interview.round_name %></td></tr>
</table>

<p>Once the interview is complete, please share your feedback using the button below. No login is required.</p>

<p style="margin:24px 0;">
  <a href="<%= @feedback_url %>" style="background:#0E8FB0;color:#fff;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;display:inline-block;">Submit Interview Feedback</a>
</p>

<p style="color:#999;font-size:12px;">If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser: <%= @feedback_url %></p>
